This directory is intended for PlatformIO Test Runner and project tests.

Unit Testing is a software testing method by which individual units of
MCU program modules are tested to determine whether they are fit for use.
All tests here run in the native environment (PC), not on the ESP32 board,
so hardware-dependent drivers (W5500, LCD I2C) are replaced with fakes.

Run:
  platformio test                    # semua test
  platformio test -f test_counter_store  # satu komponen saja
  platformio test --list             # daftar test
